----------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party source material
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The map data in this repository is derived from OpenStreetMap:

  - map.osm        the raw OpenStreetMap extract
  - shapefiles/    shapefile exports derived from that extract
  - map/*.geojson  GeoJSON conversions of the same layers

These represent the data pipeline behind the rendered map
(OSM extract -> shapefiles -> GeoJSON).

